      "comment": "SO CAN EYE (8) is racing very well with placings in three of four starts starts since he came from a similar draw to this for a win at this circuit and distance last month. Held up when second here last week, beaten 2.5 metres. With even luck he is a big chance. JOHNNY TANG (7) produced a strong effort last start when he worked but dug deep and scored by 4.7 metres at this circuit and distance. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run on the inside of the second line and if things go his way he could make it consecutive wins. GO TESS GO (3) continued her consistent form when a solid fourth from the back row last week. The better draw can see her in the finish again. FINAL PROMISE (10) cops a tricky draw but must be included on the back of some solid recent form, most recently a third after working here last week.",
